				<p>
					"Wednesday" is a Netflix TV series created by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar and directed by Tim Burton.
				</p>
				<p>
					On August 1, 2024, Kerry Shale announced that filming for Wednesday Season 2 was underway. The production was later completed in November 2024. He will portray Gabe Packard in the series. This season was filmed at a new location in Ireland.<br />
					Netflix previously revealed that the production of Season 2 was delayed due to the writers' and actors' strikes. Wednesday Season 2 is expected to be released in July 2025, nearly three years after Season 1 premiered. Let's wait and see!<br />
					Written by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar. Directed by Tim Burton.
				</p>
